{"id":"93a810534b87b0f9","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-tree.md","title":"树与路径集","display":"df-tree — 树与路径集","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-tree","aliases":["20-df-tree"],"display":"df-tree — 树与路径集","chapter":"3","section":"3.7","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Definition 3.7.1","source_pdf_pages":[107],"source_printed_pages":[71],"depends_on":["[[20-df-strings]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-tree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-tree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-tree — 树与路径集"},{"key":"chapter","html":"3"},{"key":"section","html":"3.7"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 3.7.1"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>107</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>71</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"755e421576224435\" href=\"?note=755e421576224435\" title=\"20-df-strings\">20-df-strings</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\in\\{2,\\omega\\}\">\\(D\\in\\{2,\\omega\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq D^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(T\\subseteq D^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma,\\tau\\in D^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\sigma,\\tau\\in D^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"755e421576224435\" href=\"?note=755e421576224435\" title=\"20-df-strings\">20-df-strings</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tree}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Tree}_D(T)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall\\tau\\in T\\ \\forall\\sigma\\in D^{&lt;\\omega}\\ [\\sigma\\preceq\\tau\\Rightarrow\\sigma\\in T],\\\\\n[T]:=\\{X\\in D^\\omega:\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ X\\upharpoonright n\\in T\\},\\qquad\nT_\\sigma:=\\{\\tau\\in T:\\tau\\preceq\\sigma\\lor\\sigma\\preceq\\tau\\}.\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tree}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Tree}_D(T)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall\\tau\\in T\\ \\forall\\sigma\\in D^{&lt;\\omega}\\ [\\sigma\\preceq\\tau\\Rightarrow\\sigma\\in T],\\\\\n[T]:=\\{X\\in D^\\omega:\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ X\\upharpoonright n\\in T\\},\\qquad\nT_\\sigma:=\\{\\tau\\in T:\\tau\\preceq\\sigma\\lor\\sigma\\preceq\\tau\\}.\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>树向下封闭；空树允许。子树 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_\\sigma\">\\(T_\\sigma\\)</span> 限制到经过 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span> 的路径并保留其祖先。使用 computable tree 时指其有限串编码的成员关系可计算。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 3.7.1；印刷页 71；PDF 第 107 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-strings","status":"resolved","id":"755e421576224435","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-strings]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-strings","status":"resolved","id":"755e421576224435","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-strings]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"D\\in\\{2,\\omega\\}","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq D^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma,\\tau\\in D^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tree}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Tree}_D(T)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall\\tau\\in T\\ \\forall\\sigma\\in D^{<\\omega}\\ [\\sigma\\preceq\\tau\\Rightarrow\\sigma\\in T],\\\\\n[T]:=\\{X\\in D^\\omega:\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ X\\upharpoonright n\\in T\\},\\qquad\nT_\\sigma:=\\{\\tau\\in T:\\tau\\preceq\\sigma\\lor\\sigma\\preceq\\tau\\}.\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"T_\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma","display":false}],"bytes":1219,"backlinks":[{"id":"b73290a0af01d44f","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-cantor-space]]；see [[20-df-tree]]；see [[20-df-re]]。"},{"id":"683b778af72202b5","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-cantor-space]]；see [[20-df-tree]]。"},{"id":"ecb9f43e837dcf35","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-tree]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。"},{"id":"8705fb72e379b21a","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-tree]]。"},{"id":"efc26dd0829b9c99","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-gale-stewart]]；see [[20-df-tree]]；see [[20-df-closed-class]]。"},{"id":"60a10f7c9ce5cbb7","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-tree]]；see [[20-df-cantor-bendixson]]。"},{"id":"aae185fc93a18a8a","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-tree]]；see [[20-df-cantor-bendixson]]；see [[20-ex-bounded-zero-rank]]；see [[20-df-recursive]]。"},{"id":"0287df265ebdc8d6","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数